{"cause":"Boundary review and negative tests exposed that a binding could be constructed from a copied admitted record, that an assessment floor was not rechecked, and that the resolution validity cursor was only copied.","cause_status":"known","event_id":"82ba0b93-2aa6-476a-bc8e-d1cdf7da2f42","event_sha256":"a93435090c4b900c31618d8aa1dbbe512ac33d0342d33c6d7b8fa841d112e2aa","evidence":{"kind":"review","observed_at":"2026-07-26T15:27:39.000Z","ref":"tests/test_capability_notebook_binding.py","sha256":"a19d4a86e58d67c5792cda385f9400623aade05d8d24ede25b26b4d4fb98de5a"},"impact":"Without the fixes, a copied admission or stale resolver cursor could be repackaged as a Notebook binding; the binding now requires authoritative current checks and explicit evidence-floor/freshness verification.","incident_id":"e1a7ee26-83b3-45a1-97d8-66a7b971e2d5","lesson":"A content digest proves object identity only; consumer bindings must also verify authority, current validity, and admission floors at creation and use.","lesson_key":"binding-authority-and-freshness","links":["backend/workbench/capability_factory/notebook_binding.py","tests/test_capability_notebook_binding.py"],"prev_event_sha256":"52a7cc0fede2c850765287f4a60fced085bf0b501b211ae3de7f9d7e189b857f","preventability":"preventable","resolution":"resolved","schema_version":1,"severity":"normal","stage":"review","subtype":"notebook_binding_fail_closed_review_gap","timestamp":"2026-07-26T15:27:39.000Z","type":"FAILURE"}
